# 基本図形編集の線の端の取っ手と変形を、デスクトップの図形編集とプロセスの図形編集で同じに使う
# (design 11.3, 17.13), for tools/ui_run.py. A figure of one rectangle and two zigzag lines
# (mkbig fig 1 2 0) opened at 100,100; its 道具パネル at the top of the screen (100,0), the
# first row's middles at y 48 and the second's at 82, 34 apart from x 128 (選択 298,48; 直線
# 162,82; 多角形 332,82). A line drawn from 300,250 to 500,250 (it is then picked), the
# pointer taken, and its end at 500,250 carried to 540,300. A polygon of three corners
# (300,450 400,450 350,550, Enter; the corners pressed further apart in time than a double
# press) drawn and picked; 変形 from the menu. The menu opens with the item chosen last on
# the pointer's row: the first time 閉じる, 図形操作 five rows under it; the second time, the
# system's menus remembering, 図形操作. Its own menu opens beside it with 取消 on its row and
# 変形 two rows under, the line between them. Its corner at 400,450
# carried to 430,480; Escape ends it. Saved, record 0 comes out the same, byte for byte.
# Keys: Esc 29, Enter 28; Ctrl+S 16 01, Ctrl+E 08 01.
# the desktop's figure editor opened by open, whatever the program object says (figproc kernel)
figproc kernel
mkbig fig 1 2 0
open big
waitwin 画用紙 600
sync 600
wait 500
click 162 82
wait 300
drag 300 250 500 250
wait 400
click 298 48
wait 300
drag 500 250 540 300
wait 400
shot scmp_k_end
click 332 82
wait 300
click 300 450
wait 700
click 400 450
wait 700
click 350 550
wait 700
key 28
wait 400
click 298 48
wait 300
click 600 400 1
wait 500
move 610 500
wait 400
move 720 500
wait 150
move 720 540
wait 300
shot scmp_k_menu
click 720 540
wait 500
shot scmp_k_transform
drag 400 450 430 480
wait 400
shot scmp_k_moved
key 29
wait 300
sync 600
key 16 01
sync 600
sum show
keep kernel
key 08 01
sync 600
wait 500
mkbig fig 1 2 0
logmark
pfig big
expectsincein 60 figure: opened 画用紙 shapes 3
wait 800
logmark
click 162 82
expectsince figure: tool 3
drag 300 250 500 250
expectsince figure: drawn
logmark
click 298 48
expectsince figure: tool 0
drag 500 250 540 300
expectsince figure: line end held
expectsince figure: line end put
wait 300
shot scmp_p_end
logmark
click 332 82
expectsince figure: tool 8
click 300 450
wait 700
click 400 450
wait 700
click 350 550
wait 700
key 28
expectsince figure: drawn
logmark
click 298 48
expectsince figure: tool 0
logmark
click 600 400 1
expectsince figure: menu
wait 500
move 610 400
wait 400
move 720 400
wait 300
shot scmp_p_menu
move 720 440
wait 300
click 720 440
expectsince figure: transform begun
wait 500
shot scmp_p_transform
logmark
drag 400 450 430 480
expectsince figure: transform handle held
expectsince figure: transformed
wait 300
shot scmp_p_moved
logmark
key 29
expectsince figure: transform ended
logmark
key 16 01
expectsince figure: saved (0)
sum show
same kernel
key 08 01
expect figure: closed
